# Task 146-011-fix: Sprint 145 vitest Regression Fix

## Problem
29 test files failing, 134 individual test failures out of 15024 total tests.

## Approach
1. Categorize failures by root cause
2. Fix each category systematically
3. Re-run vitest to verify

## Categories to investigate
